的长刀，可轻易将敌将拖与马下完成斩杀，亦可对敌人从造成出其不意的方向造成伤害","en":"A long saber with a sharp hook at the tip, capable of easily dragging enemy generals from their horses for the kill, or striking enemies from unexpected angles"},"atkVal":"10","price":"8500","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1017305","name":{"zh":"锦绣布袍","en":"Embroidered Robe"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"采用了普通的面料并进行了纹饰处理的衣袍，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A robe made of ordinary fabric and decorated with patterns, with simple trim also added along the edges."},"defenceVal":"5","hp":"290","price":"3000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1028705","name":{"zh":"发带","en":"Headband"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"民间随处可见的头带，摘下来看不过是一块布料而已。","en":"A common headband seen everywhere, nothing more than a strip of cloth when removed."},"mp":"100","evade":"1","price":"200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1001015","name":{"zh":"汗血","en":"Sweatblood"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"西域进贡的纯种汗血宝马，皮肤薄，血管可见，冲刺时如流血汗。","en":"A purebred blood-sweating horse presented as tribute from the Western Regions, with thin skin and visible veins that appear to sweat blood at full gallop."},"price":"10000","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{},"clans":[{"id":"GI112915","name":{"zh":"鲜卑秃发氏","en":"The Tufa clan of the Xianbei"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，鲜卑族西部支系，与拓跋部同源。三世纪初，首领秃发匹孤率部从塞北阴山迁徙至河西地区。三国后期，其部由邓艾迁至雍凉二州交界地带。至西晋时其首领秃发树机能发动大规模反晋起义。十六国时期，秃发乌孤建立南凉政权。","en":"Originating from the Donghu as a western branch of the Xianbei people, sharing common roots with the Tuoba tribe. In the early 3rd century, their chieftain Tufa Pigu led the tribe from Mount Yin north of the frontier to the Hexi region. In the late Three Kingdoms period, their tribe was relocated by Deng Ai to the border of Yong and Liang provinces. In the Western Jin dynasty, their chieftain Tufa Shujineng launched a massive rebellion against Jin. During the Sixteen Kingdoms period, Tufa Wugu established the Southern Liang state."},"talent":{"milit