1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1017305","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[55,62,65,55,72,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1017305","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[55,62,65,55,72,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1017305","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"十六国时期南凉国创始家族秃发鲜卑的首领。作为前任首领秃发树机能的堂弟，其在堂兄兵败被杀后接过了部落的权杖。西晋咸宁五年，当时其堂兄树机能因掀起秦凉之变被部下杀害。务丸因此在危难之际继立为秃发鲜卑的首领。其去世后，由孙子秃发推斤继承其位。","tc":"十六國時期南涼國創始家族禿發鮮卑的首領。作為前任首領禿發樹機能的堂弟，其在堂兄兵敗被殺后接過了部落的權杖。西晉咸寧五年，當時其堂兄樹機能因掀起秦涼之變被部下殺害。務丸因此在危難之際繼立為禿發鮮卑的首領。其去世后，由孫子禿發推斤繼承其位。","en":"A chieftain of the Tufa Xianbei, the founding family of Southern Liang during the Sixteen Kingdoms period. As the cousin of the former chieftain Tufa Shujineng, he took up the mantle of tribal leadership after his cousin was defeated and killed. In the fifth year of Xianning of the Western Jin dynasty, Shujineng was slain by his subordinates after launching the Qin-Liang Rebellion. Amidst this crisis, Wuwan succeeded him as chieftain of the Tufa Xianbei. Upon his death, he was succeeded by his grandson, Tufa Tuijin.","jp":"十六国時代の南涼の創始家族である禿髪鮮卑の首領。先代首領・禿髪樹機能の従弟であり、従兄が兵敗れて殺害された後に部族の統率権を引き継いだ。西晋の咸寧5年、従兄の樹機能が秦涼の変を起こして部下に殺害されると、務丸は危難の最中に禿髪鮮卑の首領として立った。その死後は孫の禿髪推斤が跡を継いだ。","kr":"십육국 시대 남량 건국 가문인 독발선비의 수령이다. 전임 수령 독발수기능의 사촌 동생으로, 사촌 형이 패망하여 목숨을 잃은 뒤 부족의 통솔권을 이어받았다. 서진 함녕 5년, 사촌 형 수기능이 진량의 변을 일으켰다가 부하에게 살해당하자, 무환이 위기 속에서 독발선비의 수령으로 추대되었다. 사후에는 손자 독발퇴근이 그 자리를 계승했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1047015","remark":"普武","surname":"秃发","surnameTc":"禿發","surnameEn":"Tufa","surnameJp":"禿髪","surnameKr":"독발","surnameOther":"","name":"务丸","nameTc":"務丸","nameEn":"Wuwan","nameJp":"務丸","nameKr":"무환","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"秃发务丸","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1076","gender":"0","rule":"55","force":"62","wise":"65","politics":"55","charm":"72","will":"61","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"36/62/32/25/32/27/25/27","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4300","battleSoulPoint":"3300","debateSoulPoint":"4400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010301;1001005;1001715","professions":"2/3/3/3/0/0/2/0/0/0/3/3/2/1/2/0/3/1/0/0/0/3/4/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"32","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","evaluate":"-1300","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"231","show":"244","death":"308","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1017305","helmet":"WP1028705","treasure":"","horse":"WP1001015","shield":"","character":"0/2;1/2;7/1;19/1;33/1;3/1;28/2;30/2;9/2;13/1;43/0;22/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"十六国时期南凉国创始家族秃发鲜卑的首领。作为前任首领秃发树机能的堂弟，其在堂兄兵败被杀后接过了部落的权杖。西晋咸宁五年，当时其堂兄树机能因掀起秦凉之